# Compatibility projections of state graphs owned by current Wellmanifest
# *-lifecycle standards. Domain validators retain payload and effect semantics.

LIFECYCLE git-repository VERSION 1
DESCRIPTION "Repository bootstrap, review, integration, release and cleanup"
STATE UNINITIALIZED INITIAL
STATE SEEDED
STATE TICKET_READY
STATE IMPLEMENTATION_LOCAL
STATE REVIEW_OPEN
STATE INTEGRATED
STATE RELEASED
STATE TERMINAL TERMINAL
EVENT SEED_BASELINE
EVENT CREATE_TICKET_BRANCH
EVENT LOCAL_COMMIT
EVENT OPEN_PR
EVENT INTEGRATE
EVENT RELEASE
EVENT CLEANUP
EVIDENCE SESSION_EXECUTION_AUTHORIZATION
EVIDENCE BOUNDED_TICKET_INTENT
EVIDENCE LOCAL_COMMIT_AUTHORIZATION
EVIDENCE REVIEWABLE_DIFF
EVIDENCE TRUSTED_CURRENT_HEAD_APPROVAL
EVIDENCE RELEASE_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE CLEANUP_PROOF
TRANSITION UNINITIALIZED -> SEEDED ON SEED_BASELINE REQUIRES SESSION_EXECUTION_AUTHORIZATION
TRANSITION SEEDED -> TICKET_READY ON CREATE_TICKET_BRANCH REQUIRES BOUNDED_TICKET_INTENT
TRANSITION TICKET_READY -> IMPLEMENTATION_LOCAL ON LOCAL_COMMIT REQUIRES LOCAL_COMMIT_AUTHORIZATION
TRANSITION IMPLEMENTATION_LOCAL -> REVIEW_OPEN ON OPEN_PR REQUIRES REVIEWABLE_DIFF
TRANSITION REVIEW_OPEN -> INTEGRATED ON INTEGRATE REQUIRES TRUSTED_CURRENT_HEAD_APPROVAL
TRANSITION INTEGRATED -> RELEASED ON RELEASE REQUIRES RELEASE_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION INTEGRATED -> TERMINAL ON CLEANUP REQUIRES CLEANUP_PROOF
TRANSITION RELEASED -> TERMINAL ON CLEANUP REQUIRES CLEANUP_PROOF
END

LIFECYCLE governed-ticket VERSION 1
DESCRIPTION "Bounded ticket from allocation through publication, blocking and closure"
STATE UNALLOCATED INITIAL
STATE ALLOCATED
STATE PLANNED
STATE AUTHORIZED
STATE EDITING
STATE VALIDATING
STATE PUBLICATION
STATE BLOCKED
STATE DONE TERMINAL
EVENT ALLOCATE
EVENT PLAN
EVENT AUTHORIZE
EVENT EDIT
EVENT VALIDATE
EVENT PUBLISH
EVENT CLOSE
EVENT BLOCK
EVENT RESUME
EVIDENCE ALLOCATION_PROOF
EVIDENCE BOUNDED_INTENT
EVIDENCE SESSION_EXECUTION_AUTHORIZATION
EVIDENCE ACCEPTED_BASE
EVIDENCE VALIDATION_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE REVIEWABLE_PUBLICATION
EVIDENCE TRUSTED_INTEGRATION
EVIDENCE BLOCKER_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE BLOCKER_RESOLUTION
TRANSITION UNALLOCATED -> ALLOCATED ON ALLOCATE REQUIRES ALLOCATION_PROOF
TRANSITION ALLOCATED -> PLANNED ON PLAN REQUIRES BOUNDED_INTENT
TRANSITION PLANNED -> AUTHORIZED ON AUTHORIZE REQUIRES SESSION_EXECUTION_AUTHORIZATION
TRANSITION AUTHORIZED -> EDITING ON EDIT REQUIRES ACCEPTED_BASE
TRANSITION EDITING -> VALIDATING ON VALIDATE REQUIRES VALIDATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION VALIDATING -> PUBLICATION ON PUBLISH REQUIRES REVIEWABLE_PUBLICATION
TRANSITION PUBLICATION -> DONE ON CLOSE REQUIRES TRUSTED_INTEGRATION
TRANSITION ALLOCATED -> BLOCKED ON BLOCK REQUIRES BLOCKER_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION PLANNED -> BLOCKED ON BLOCK REQUIRES BLOCKER_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION AUTHORIZED -> BLOCKED ON BLOCK REQUIRES BLOCKER_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION EDITING -> BLOCKED ON BLOCK REQUIRES BLOCKER_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION VALIDATING -> BLOCKED ON BLOCK REQUIRES BLOCKER_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION PUBLICATION -> BLOCKED ON BLOCK REQUIRES BLOCKER_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION BLOCKED -> PLANNED ON RESUME REQUIRES BLOCKER_RESOLUTION
END

LIFECYCLE legal-obligation VERSION 1
DESCRIPTION "Location-bound legal obligation and grant compatibility projection"
STATE UNBOUND INITIAL
STATE BOUND
STATE ACCEPTED
STATE RESTRICTED
STATE WITHDRAWN TERMINAL
STATE EXPIRED
STATE DENIED TERMINAL
EVENT BIND_JURISDICTION
EVENT ACCEPT_POLICY
EVENT GRANT_LICENSE
EVENT RESTRICT
EVENT WITHDRAW
EVENT EXPIRE
EVENT DENY
EVIDENCE JURISDICTION_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE POLICY_ACCEPTANCE
EVIDENCE LICENSE_GRANT
EVIDENCE POLICY_DECISION
EVIDENCE WITHDRAWAL_DECISION
EVIDENCE EXPIRATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION UNBOUND -> BOUND ON BIND_JURISDICTION REQUIRES JURISDICTION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION UNBOUND -> DENIED ON DENY REQUIRES POLICY_DECISION
TRANSITION BOUND -> ACCEPTED ON ACCEPT_POLICY REQUIRES POLICY_ACCEPTANCE
TRANSITION BOUND -> RESTRICTED ON RESTRICT REQUIRES POLICY_DECISION
TRANSITION BOUND -> EXPIRED ON EXPIRE REQUIRES EXPIRATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION ACCEPTED -> ACCEPTED ON GRANT_LICENSE REQUIRES LICENSE_GRANT
TRANSITION ACCEPTED -> RESTRICTED ON RESTRICT REQUIRES POLICY_DECISION
TRANSITION ACCEPTED -> WITHDRAWN ON WITHDRAW REQUIRES WITHDRAWAL_DECISION
TRANSITION ACCEPTED -> EXPIRED ON EXPIRE REQUIRES EXPIRATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION RESTRICTED -> WITHDRAWN ON WITHDRAW REQUIRES WITHDRAWAL_DECISION
TRANSITION EXPIRED -> BOUND ON BIND_JURISDICTION REQUIRES JURISDICTION_EVIDENCE
END

LIFECYCLE product-release VERSION 1
DESCRIPTION "Product registration, release, restriction, deprecation and sunset"
STATE DRAFT INITIAL
STATE PREVIEW
STATE GENERALLY_AVAILABLE
STATE RESTRICTED
STATE DEPRECATED
STATE WITHDRAWN
STATE SUNSET TERMINAL
EVENT REGISTER
EVENT RELEASE
EVENT RESTRICT
EVENT DEPRECATE
EVENT WITHDRAW
EVENT SUNSET
EVIDENCE REGISTRATION_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE RELEASE_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE RESTRICTION_DECISION
EVIDENCE DEPRECATION_DECISION
EVIDENCE WITHDRAWAL_DECISION
EVIDENCE SUNSET_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION DRAFT -> PREVIEW ON REGISTER REQUIRES REGISTRATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION DRAFT -> GENERALLY_AVAILABLE ON RELEASE REQUIRES RELEASE_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION PREVIEW -> GENERALLY_AVAILABLE ON RELEASE REQUIRES RELEASE_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION GENERALLY_AVAILABLE -> RESTRICTED ON RESTRICT REQUIRES RESTRICTION_DECISION
TRANSITION GENERALLY_AVAILABLE -> DEPRECATED ON DEPRECATE REQUIRES DEPRECATION_DECISION
TRANSITION GENERALLY_AVAILABLE -> WITHDRAWN ON WITHDRAW REQUIRES WITHDRAWAL_DECISION
TRANSITION RESTRICTED -> DEPRECATED ON DEPRECATE REQUIRES DEPRECATION_DECISION
TRANSITION RESTRICTED -> WITHDRAWN ON WITHDRAW REQUIRES WITHDRAWAL_DECISION
TRANSITION DEPRECATED -> WITHDRAWN ON WITHDRAW REQUIRES WITHDRAWAL_DECISION
TRANSITION WITHDRAWN -> SUNSET ON SUNSET REQUIRES SUNSET_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION DEPRECATED -> SUNSET ON SUNSET REQUIRES SUNSET_EVIDENCE
END

LIFECYCLE saas-tenant VERSION 1
DESCRIPTION "Commercial tenant state with verified billing and provisioning boundaries"
STATE REQUESTED INITIAL
STATE MEMBERSHIP_VERIFIED
STATE TRIAL_ACTIVE
STATE TRIAL_EXPIRING
STATE PAYMENT_PENDING
STATE PAID_PENDING_PROVISIONING
STATE ACTIVE
STATE PLAN_CHANGE_PENDING
STATE SUSPENDED
STATE CANCELLED TERMINAL
STATE EXPIRED TERMINAL
STATE FAILED TERMINAL
EVENT SIGNUP
EVENT START_TRIAL
EVENT TRIAL_NOTICE
EVENT SELECT_PLAN
EVENT CONFIRM_SUBSCRIPTION
EVENT PROVISION
EVENT PURCHASE_ADDON
EVENT REQUEST_PLAN_CHANGE
EVENT ACTIVATE_PLAN_CHANGE
EVENT SUSPEND
EVENT RESUME
EVENT CANCEL
EVENT EXPIRE
EVENT FAIL
EVIDENCE MEMBERSHIP_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE TRIAL_POLICY
EVIDENCE NOTICE_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE PLAN_SELECTION
EVIDENCE VERIFIED_BILLING
EVIDENCE VERIFIED_DEPLOYMENT
EVIDENCE VERIFIED_USAGE_GRANT
EVIDENCE PLAN_CHANGE_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE SUSPENSION_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE CANCELLATION_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE EXPIRATION_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE FAILURE_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION REQUESTED -> MEMBERSHIP_VERIFIED ON SIGNUP REQUIRES MEMBERSHIP_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION MEMBERSHIP_VERIFIED -> TRIAL_ACTIVE ON START_TRIAL REQUIRES TRIAL_POLICY
TRANSITION MEMBERSHIP_VERIFIED -> PAYMENT_PENDING ON SELECT_PLAN REQUIRES PLAN_SELECTION
TRANSITION TRIAL_ACTIVE -> TRIAL_EXPIRING ON TRIAL_NOTICE REQUIRES NOTICE_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION TRIAL_EXPIRING -> PAYMENT_PENDING ON SELECT_PLAN REQUIRES PLAN_SELECTION
TRANSITION PAYMENT_PENDING -> PAID_PENDING_PROVISIONING ON CONFIRM_SUBSCRIPTION REQUIRES VERIFIED_BILLING
TRANSITION PAID_PENDING_PROVISIONING -> ACTIVE ON PROVISION REQUIRES VERIFIED_DEPLOYMENT
TRANSITION ACTIVE -> ACTIVE ON PURCHASE_ADDON REQUIRES VERIFIED_USAGE_GRANT
TRANSITION ACTIVE -> PLAN_CHANGE_PENDING ON REQUEST_PLAN_CHANGE REQUIRES PLAN_CHANGE_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION PLAN_CHANGE_PENDING -> ACTIVE ON ACTIVATE_PLAN_CHANGE REQUIRES VERIFIED_DEPLOYMENT
TRANSITION ACTIVE -> SUSPENDED ON SUSPEND REQUIRES SUSPENSION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION SUSPENDED -> ACTIVE ON RESUME REQUIRES VERIFIED_BILLING
TRANSITION TRIAL_ACTIVE -> CANCELLED ON CANCEL REQUIRES CANCELLATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION ACTIVE -> CANCELLED ON CANCEL REQUIRES CANCELLATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION TRIAL_EXPIRING -> EXPIRED ON EXPIRE REQUIRES EXPIRATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION SUSPENDED -> EXPIRED ON EXPIRE REQUIRES EXPIRATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION PAID_PENDING_PROVISIONING -> FAILED ON FAIL REQUIRES FAILURE_EVIDENCE
END

LIFECYCLE twin-stage VERSION 1
DESCRIPTION "Digital Twin stage blueprint with controlled evidence-backed evolution"
STATE CONCEPT INITIAL
STATE MODELED
STATE VALIDATED
STATE RELEASED
STATE OPERATING
STATE EVOLVING
STATE RETIRED TERMINAL
EVENT MODEL
EVENT VALIDATE
EVENT RELEASE
EVENT OPERATE
EVENT EVOLVE
EVENT STABILIZE
EVENT RETIRE
EVIDENCE MODEL_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE VALIDATION_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE RELEASE_APPROVAL
EVIDENCE OPERATION_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE CHANGE_APPROVAL
EVIDENCE STABILIZATION_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE RETIREMENT_APPROVAL
TRANSITION CONCEPT -> MODELED ON MODEL REQUIRES MODEL_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION MODELED -> VALIDATED ON VALIDATE REQUIRES VALIDATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION VALIDATED -> RELEASED ON RELEASE REQUIRES RELEASE_APPROVAL
TRANSITION RELEASED -> OPERATING ON OPERATE REQUIRES OPERATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION OPERATING -> EVOLVING ON EVOLVE REQUIRES CHANGE_APPROVAL
TRANSITION EVOLVING -> OPERATING ON STABILIZE REQUIRES STABILIZATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION OPERATING -> RETIRED ON RETIRE REQUIRES RETIREMENT_APPROVAL
END
